// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Playbill 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2766249966" "Playbill"
// DetailString :
"P2017171188" "The sick grin of the clown on this brightly-colored playbill startles you. You could swear you've seen a similar smile on the faces of your many enemies. The text within promises the reader a night of unparalleled pleasure and wonderment. It's obviously designed to appeal to Paragon City's edgier crowd: those who equate terror with excitement."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HostageStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2570771214" "The audience member's story"
// DetailString :
"P2329834999" "One of the citizens you rescued from the Carnival of Shadows told you: <br><br>'I don't remember much, but I know I had a great time! I hear these guys are doing another performance over in the Cassidy Industrial Park. Maybe you should check it out.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1594751343" "Have you heard of that new carnival that has come to town recently? The Carnival of Shadows? It's become very popular is a short time, but something about it just doesn't feel right to me. They're planning a performance over in the Faunton Park neighborhood later today. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Would you check out the Carnival of Shadows?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2112229451" "Check out the Carnival of Shadows"
// SendOffString :
"P2247828242" "You'll need to take the Light Rail to get to Faunton Park. Just in case there's trouble, I've asked the city to erect an emergency force field around the area. I can't say why exactly, but I'm pretty sure there's something amiss."

