// Clue - AlfredStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2536992478" "Alfred van Bortel's story"
// DetailString :
"P3747057712" "When you rescued Alfred van Bortel from the Carnival of Shadows, he told you: <br><br>'It started last week, when I noticed some unusual charges on the credit card of my client, Adrianna Hollister. Adrianna's a bit of a playgirl, so it wasn't too unusual to see her spend a lot of cash. But these charges! Thousands of dollars funneled directly from Adrianna's credit card to a numbered Swiss bank account. Something wasn't right. I think Adrianna's being blackmailed! But when I started asking questions, these strange clowns came after me!<br><br>'The last I heard of Adrianna, she was going to a rave in Brickstown. Please help her, {HeroName}! She could be in real trouble!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2511389007" "I just got a call from Alfred van Bortel, a lawyer who I've been friends with for some time. He seemed to think he was in danger! He was too flustered to say much on the phone, but I gathered that it had something to do with that strange Carnival of Shadows. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you get over there and make sure Alfred is safe?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3880705807" "Make sure Alfred is safe from the Carnival of Shadows"
// SendOffString :
"P3652874977" "For the life of me, I can't imagine why the Carnival would want to harm a middle-aged tax attorney. Can you?"

