// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3342705776" "Hey, {HeroName}! Give up the goodies!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1189024603" "It certainly looks as though Councilman Klein deliberately left these files for the Carnival to find. It's heinous, {HeroName}. He planned to sell out all those undercover officers. Good work, deputy. I'm going to have him brought in right away."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1544329242" "Councilman Klein's claiming that he didn't help the Carnival deliberately; he says he was the victim of their strange hypnotists. We may never know whether he's telling the truth, but one thing is certain: we'll have to watch each other much more closely from now on. If the Carnival can truly make us act against our wishes, they may be your most challenging enemy yet!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1574929723" "Did you know that Councilman Klein was dirty? It's true! {HeroName} said so!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Carnival_Compound5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CarnieStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3634180137" "The carnie's story"
// DetailString :
"P1578507479" "One of the Carnival minions you defeated told you: <br><br>'You idiot! We could have stopped the Rikti! The Rikti have developed some sort of mutagenic serum. They're going to sneak it into the fertility drugs in storage over at Harvey Medical Center. Thousands of women will give birth to Rikti scum!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Map 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4190923240" "Rikti map"
// DetailString :
"P1930734630" "Though most of the symbols on this map make no sense to you, you can make out the familiar terrain of Independence Port. A large black symbol seems to be a likely base location."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CarnieStory2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2881299000" "The Carnival's history"
// DetailString :
"P4250287079" "One of the Carnival minions you defeated told you: <br><br>'Ever since the Rikti arrived, the Carnival of Shadows has fought them. We were there in the first battles. Do you think Earth's heroes could have fought so well on their own? No! The Carnival was there, in their minds, guiding them to victory!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1542442354" "Listen up, {HeroName}. I just heard that the Carnival of Shadows has invaded a Rikti base, and they're planning to massacre every single Rikti inside. Personally, I wouldn't be too sorry to see those two groups annihilate each other. But the base is close to a populated area in Brickstown, and neither of those groups has ever shown much respect for human life. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can't stop the battle between the Rikti and the Carnival, it may endanger innocent civilians.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3453137745" "Stop the battle between the Rikti and the Carnival"
// SendOffString :
"P4150091984" "You're the best, peaches. While you're over there, see if you can find out what started this little war."

