// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Carnival_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RANDOM_BUSINESS 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4288632555" "I just got a call from the Buchman-Blackman office complex over in Founders' Falls. The Carnival of Shadows has invaded, and they're up to more than their usual parlor tricks. They've set up explosives! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Somebody's got to get over there and defuse the situation.</A> Are you up for the job, {HeroName}? You only have 75 minutes to stop the bombing. One more thing: the Carnival may be using an interconnected network of bombs. <color orange>So I'd bring a couple of friends if I were you.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P644798418" "Save the office workers from the Carnival"
// SendOffString :
"P1013803554" "I'll let them know you're on the way."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1929843878" "Defeat all clowns in office"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2998868583" "Have you stopped the Carnival from terrorizing those office workers yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1931938281" "You hear a voice remark, 'Now this! This is going to be art!'"

