// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2132728276" "You rescued the office workers from the Carnival of Shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4128923502" "The Carnival has done significant damage to the Buchman-Blackman office complex."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1678340510" "Ugh. The Carnival wanted to kill those people, all in the name of art? Pretty gross. I wonder what kind of statement they planned to make? Probably one about the precious brevity of life, or something. Whoa. If I'm starting to think like the Carnival, maybe I've been in this business too long."
// RandomFameString :
"P1332891145" "Did you hear that {HeroName} saved my office building from the Carnival?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1927778296" "The good news is, everyone got out alive. The bad news is, they'll all be looking for new jobs. The building is gone, bombed into smithereens! The Carnival claims it's some sort of artistic statement, but personally, I think it's just appalling."
// RandomFameString :
"P1597758822" "My office building was bombed by the Carnival. I guess I'll have to dip into my savings until I can find a new job."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Carnival_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RANDOM_MALE_UNKEMPT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Slave 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1287919462" "The slave's story"
// DetailString :
"P3752800927" "One of the Carnival slaves you rescued told you: <br><br>'Almost all of the Carnival's minions are under some degree of mind control. I don't know who the great and powerful Carnival Mistress is, but she lives in all our minds. It is her awesome psychic power that the Ring Mistresses wield. If you can find her and stop her, the whole Carnival will fall apart!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SlaveLetter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1805195577" "Letter"
// DetailString :
"P4231415335" "This letter arrived this morning along with Madeleine's fan mail. It reads: <br><br>'I don't know how long I've served the Carnival, or what my life was like before. I only know I was content, until they made me kill another man. Please help me! I must get away before I lose myself entirely!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4127529310" "I received this strange letter with my fan mail. Brace yourself, {HeroName}, it's pretty sad. It sounds as though the writer has been imprisoned by the Carnival of Shadows! Not only that, he's been forced to do terrible things! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We've got to do everything we can to rescue this person from the Carnival.</A> Are you with me?"
// AcceptString :
"P917229254" "Rescue the letter's writer from the Carnival"
// SendOffString :
"P2654478794" "Thanks for taking this on, {HeroName}. It's important to me that I answer every single fan letter with an appropriate response."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P848589614" "Rescue Carnival's slaves"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P686273926" "If the Carnival is holding someone against his will, you've got to save him!"

