// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P12495283" "Brr, {HeroName}, the Carnival is really giving me the shivers lately. Are you saying that every single Carnival member is psychically connected to their leader? All of their mental skills are based on the talents of one woman? This mysterious Carnival Mistress must be incredibly powerful. I hope when the time comes to battle her, we'll be ready."
// RandomFameString :
"P1002714868" "My dad's been missing for almost a year. Thanks to {HeroName}, he's back!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Carnival_Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RANDOM_MODEL 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AudienceStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3404012880" "One of the audience members you rescued from the Carnival of Shadows told you:<br><br>'It all started out as great fun! They asked for volunteers, hypnotized a few people. I was having a great time! There was this one guy who had been up on stage for hours. They made him quack like a duck, serve tea, and tell us about his first girlfriend. But after a while, his face started to go slack. And then he collapsed. Oh, {HeroName}, it's awful, but I think he's dead!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Body 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2947183092" "Unmarked body"
// DetailString :
"P1599398398" "This body appears to be in perfect physical condition. There is nothing to explain how this man died."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2204818742" "No matter how many times I try to get the word out about the Carnival's evil tricks, some people just won't listen. They're still the most popular show in town! I picked up a flyer about their next performance at the supermarket today; it promises 'A Night to end all Nights.' I don't know about you, {HeroName}, but I don't like the sound of that statement. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think you better attend the Carnival's next performance and make sure things don't get too out of hand.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1721035118" "Attend the Carnival's next performance"
// SendOffString :
"P2517981804" "I had a feeling you'd say yes. That's why I already bought you a ticket!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2907351528" "Save audience from Carnival"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3283445809" "I'm afraid that performance could get out of hand."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4220002062" "The acoustics of this renovated warehouse are excellent. And the limited exits make it an ideal facility for imprisoning unwilling guests."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3392344232" "Do you think that death was an accident?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3419293538" "I'll tell you what it was. Art, baby, art!"

