"P4290987891" "I'm through with avant garde theater!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2498288452" "You rescued the citizens from the Carnival of Shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3118683225" "The surviving audience members are reporting feelings of listlessness and confusion. They're not themselves. I wonder if that has anything to do with the man who wound up dead. The doctors can't find a thing wrong with him. If I had to guess, I'd say the Carnival has been drawing some sort of energy from their audiences. And it was enough to kill one of them."
// RandomFameString :
"P1887510890" "Did you hear about the guy who wound up dead at the Carnival of Shadows? I bet it was just a publicity stunt!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Carnival_Mission9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3638129103" "Have you hear of Samson Grey, the famous track star? His agent just called me. Samson's gone missing, and the only clue was a floppy harlequin hat. You know what that means! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The Carnival has Samson Grey, and I need you to go and rescue him!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P608944059" "Rescue Samson Grey from the Carnival"
// SendOffString :
"P3682859835" "Samson's a fine young man in the prime of his life. I'd hate to see anything happen to him."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2706221006" "Defeat all carnies in warehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P109916917" "Have you found Samson Grey yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P158072174" "This warehouse is one of the many the Carnival has purchased and renovated."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
