"P859374727" "Must kill!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1067082507" "You defeated the Carnival of Shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3690877966" "After you brought Samson into custody, the doctors examined him. {HeroName}, it's the craziest thing! He can move, he can walk, he can even fight! But he isn't breathing. He's got no pulse, and his skin is ice cold. {HeroName}, I don't think those strong men are the Carnival's servants at all! I think they're reanimated corpses!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1165784852" "Nuts. Samson Grey's next track meet got cancelled."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Carnival_Mission10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MistressStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P1020607897" "One of the Carnival minions you defeated told you: <br><br>'We did the right thing! Those Nemesis soldiers who died? Well, they were harassing some poor civilian woman. Things got out of hand, and she wound up dead! It took a lot of effort, but we managed to hand out some justice. Nemesis is the evil one, not us!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2536403897" "A group of Nemesis soldiers were found dead in a Brickstown alley this morning. The weird thing is, the forensic experts say they murdered each other! Nemesis soldiers aren't renowned for their honor, but I've never known them to turn on one another. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you go check out the area where the soldiers died?</A> Something about this just doesn't feel right."
// AcceptString :
"P666877824" "Check out the area where the soldiers died"
// SendOffString :
"P2220100394" "Watch your back, {HeroName}. If those soldiers were killed by some other person, he or she isn't mucking about."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3295410402" "Defeat all villains in warehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2990963022" "We need to know more about those strange Nemesis deaths."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2064753627" "A carnie's mad laugh mingles horribly with the racket of an automatic weapon."

