"P1427193915" "You're history, pal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2260796729" "One of the Carnival minions you defeated told you, 'Nemesis is the evil one! We did the right thing!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P465481085" "So, the Carnival forced those soldiers to kill one another? {HeroName}, I think that's the worst thing I've ever heard. But it sounds like, in their own twisted way, the carnies thought they were doing the right thing. They were trying to protect their neighborhood from the dangers of Nemesis."
// RandomFameString :
"P916664181" "{HeroName} took on the Carnival and Nemesis, all at once!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Carnival_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1433199021" "I've got word that the Carnival is up to their usual tricks over in Peregrine Island. They're manipulating the people over there, making them perform for their amusement. Most of the time they only toy with people, but every once in a while, someone winds up hurt. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over there and close down the Carnival's show.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3350514516" "Close down the Carnival's show"
// SendOffString :
"P1360627357" "You can usually find the Carnival near Bayside Docks or Curry Cove. But I'm sure any neighborhood in the zone could use your assistance."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2324889377" "Combat Carnival in Peregrine"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P207473960" "I'm still hearing reports of the Carnival manipulating citizens in Peregrine Island. {HeroName}, this has to stop!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1993442373" "Hey, {HeroName}! Smells like someone needs a shower!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1105555046" "You discouraged the Carnival from manipulating the citizens of Peregrine Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P892345850" "Thanks for taking care of that Carnival problem over in Peregrine Island. As I'm sure you know, the safety of Paragon citizens is of utmost importance to me. But their dignity deserves protection as well."
// RandomFameString :
"P234847806" "If {HeroName} isn't afraid of the Carnival, maybe I don't have to be!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Carnival_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - List 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3718637793" "List of names"
// DetailString :
"P1038346060" "This list of Carnival collaborators is extensive. It seems that half the governmental bodies in the city have a collaborator sitting in their midst. One of the names is that of Tobias Werner, a state Senator who makes his home in Paragon City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P904735223" "Ever since the Carnival of Shadows came to town, it seems as though we can't trust anyone. Every day, I hear of another politician or celebrity who's joined forces with the Carnival. Well, it looks like there's another one. Sources tell me that a member of the State Senate is actually working for the Carnival! The trouble is, we don't know which one! That's where you come in. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to hit the streets and see if you can dig up some dirt.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1980748700" "Find out who is helping the Carnival"
// SendOffString :
"P1099233872" "You can usually find the Carnival's minions in Peregrine Island. Perhaps they can tell you what's what."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1660888248" "Unmask Carnival collaborator"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3851082326" "We need to know who is secretly working for the Carnival."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3120875546" "Hey, {HeroName}! Your mother wears army boots!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2213038416" "You found a list of names."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3228142270" "Whoa, {HeroName}, you got all that I asked for and more! I'm a little dismayed by the sheer number of names you found. It seems the Carnival has more allies that I ever realized!"
// RandomFameString :
"P607049580" "{HeroName} unmasked another of the Carnival's stooges!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Carnival_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2379285970" "The Carnival has come up with a clever way of meeting expenses over in Peregrine Island. They pickpocket the citizens in broad daylight, then erase all memory of the thefts! Let me tell you, that makes it hard for the police to take a statement. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want these brazen thefts stopped, {HeroName}, and I think you can do it.</A> Are you willing to lend a hand?"
// AcceptString :
"P2156429772" "Stop the Carnival's thefts"
// SendOffString :
"P1229450632" "The Carnival's antics are at their worst over in Nelson Borough and Bayside Docks. But the whole zone could use a good clearing out."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P561947047" "I'm still hearing a lot of thefts reported in Peregrine Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3162444369" "Nice costume! Lose a bet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2543167049" "You have discouraged the Carnival's thefts in Peregrine Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2370578565" "Thanks, {HeroName}. You did good work out there. The citizens of Peregrine Island can walk the streets in safety again, and the Carnival is short a few minions."
// RandomFameString :
"P2684104292" "Those Carnival clowns won't be picking any more pockets, thanks to {HeroName}!"
